Vp5 p5v 0 5
Vp13 p13v5 0 13.5
Vp12 p12v_a 0 12
Vm4 m4v_a 0 -4
Vp3v3a p3v3_a 0 3.3
Vref vref 0 2.5
* SMU_ON: a pin of the controller behind its output resistance
Vsmu smu_pin 0 3.3
Rsmu smu_pin smu_on 33
* 5V_OK: released by the supervisor, pulled up by R25 against its loads
Vok ok_5v 0 4.717
* the path to the device under test, as three resistors: the closed
* source pair, the shunt of the range with its switch, the closed
* output pair with copper and contacts
Rpair ldo_out supply 0.0106
Rshunt supply vout_s 1000
Rpath vout_s dut 0.0306
